  "originalQuery": "As a Database Engineer, you have been assigned to design a Firestore database for a high-traffic web application. The database has the following performance requirements: 500 reads per second (RPS) 1,000 writes per second (RPS) 1 TB of storage capacity Considering the above requirements, which Firestore mode and storage solution should you choose for your Firestore instance?",
