  "tip": "<p>Start by matching workload patterns and client needs. Prefer <i>Native mode</i> for new mobile and web apps that need real-time features and massive scale. Treat any option that suggests choosing <i>HDD</i> or mixing storage types for Firestore as a distractor since Firestore abstracts storage. Be cautious of <i>Datastore mode</i> in new designs due to contention patterns and limited feature fit.</p>",
